# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances {#use-ibm-cloud-platform-"
"apis-to-access-instances}"
msgstr ""
"Usa le API della piattaforma IBM Cloud per accedere alle istanze {#use-ibm-"
"cloud-platform-apis-to-access-instances}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for anyone using the IBM Cloud Platform APIs to provision, "
"update, or manage access to instances. It provides details on the "
"[parameters](#parameters) you can set when provisioning an instance, as well"
" as the set of [extension fields](#extensions) returned when you access an "
"instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Questa guida è rivolta a chi utilizza le API della piattaforma IBM Cloud per"
" eseguire il provisioning, aggiornare o gestire l'accesso alle istanze. "
"Fornisce dettagli sui [parametri](#parameters) che puoi impostare durante il"
" provisioning di un'istanza, nonché l'insieme dei [campi di "
"estensione](#extensions) restituiti quando accedi a un'istanza.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Refer to the IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Consulta la documentazione dell'API ResourceController di IBM Cloud&reg; per ulteriori informazioni.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some relevant pages:\n"
"- [Create (provision) a new resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Update a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a list of all resource instances](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)  \n"
msgstr ""
"Alcune pagine pertinenti:\n"
"- [Crea (provisioning) una nuova istanza di risorsa](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Aggiorna un'istanza di risorsa](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Ottieni un'istanza di risorsa](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Ottieni un elenco di tutte le istanze di risorsa](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When getting a list of all resource instances, note that you can filter to "
"only Qiskit Runtime instances with `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"
msgstr ""
"Quando recuperi l'elenco di tutte le istanze di risorsa, tieni presente che "
"puoi filtrare per ottenere solo le istanze Qiskit Runtime con `resource_id ="
" \"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"

